              "content": "<p>Closing the dispute for a charge indicates that you do not have any evidence to submit and are essentially dismissing the dispute, acknowledging it as lost.</p>\n\n<p>The status of the dispute will change from <code>needs_response</code> to <code>lost</code>. <em>Closing a dispute is irreversible</em>.</p>",
